// Go workspace for SCHAT.
//
// SCHAT is split into two completely independent deliverables (see SCHAT.md
// section 9): the Android client under android/ and the relay server under
// server/. The SCS-1 protocol core lives in protocol/ and is consumed by both
// the server (structure/envelope handling only) and, through gomobile, by the
// Android client.
//
// This workspace file exists purely for local development convenience so that
// `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` work from the repository root without
// publishing the protocol module first. Production builds of the server still
// work standalone because server/go.mod carries a replace directive.
go 1.27

use (
	./protocol
	./server
)
